  "description": "Queen Clara of Balladene is in a tough spot! After her sudden coronation takes her from carefree student to queen overnight, she faces the impossible task of holding court with excessively judgement lords. But a new face appears in court, albeit behind a jingling jester’s mask, and this handsome jester has a proposal: use the power of goofs and gossip to sway the lords. With few allies in the castle, will a friendship with the court jester bring Clara more ridicule or a path to rule on her own terms? And just who is this mysterious jester, anyway?\nSource: Webtoon",
